---
/**
 * A Bayer-dithered lit sphere — the emblem a BBS flyer would set in the
 * corner. Lambert shading with a gentle gamma, sampled onto " ░▒▓█", and
 * x squashed because a monospace cell is about 1:2 and an unsquashed
 * sphere renders as an egg.
 *
 * Rendered at 44x22 rather than 30x15: at the smaller size the Bayer
 * pattern straddled ramp steps across the whole lit face and read as
 * stripes instead of shading.
 *
 * Decorative, so hidden from assistive tech.
 */
---

<pre class="ascii emblem" aria-hidden="true">                                            
